# Template drift allowlist for zmanuals-doc.
# Generated projects start from create-zudo-doc templates; this file lists
# intentional divergences from the pinned create-zudo-doc baseline so
# `check-template-drift.sh` exits 0.
#
# Format: one repo-relative path per line (no leading slash).
# Blank lines and `#` comments are ignored.
#
# Paths are relative to doc/ (the workspace package root that check-template-drift.sh
# uses as ROOT_DIR).
#
# STATUS (S3 — completed): All files that were [DIFF] against the create-zudo-doc
# template were evaluated. None were byte-identical (Category-A), so no auto-
# deletes were made. All drifted files are allowlisted as KEEP because:
#   - The project predates create-zudo-doc and carries intentional zmanuals
#     customizations (SiteTreeNav, MermaidEnlarge, ClientRouterBootstrap, etc.)
#   - Key config files (i18n.ts, color-schemes.ts, settings-types.ts, etc.)
#     are project-owned definitions, not package re-exports.
#   - Island components (sidebar-toggle, sidebar-tree, desktop-sidebar-toggle,
#     etc.) carry project-specific customizations and are kept as local stubs.
#   - src/integrations/claude-resources/ is a host-side integration; test-wisdom
#     keeps it and so does this project.
# Ejection was not performed for any component — KEEP is the correct default.

